<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>mapx Blog – Traffic</title><link>https://blog.mapx.at/tags/traffic/</link><description>Recent content in Traffic on mapx Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>de</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 04:50:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mapx.at/tags/traffic/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Navigation: closures, voice and banner instructions</title><link>https://blog.mapx.at/navigation-sperren-sprach-und-bannerhinweise-en/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 04:50:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mapx.at/navigation-sperren-sprach-und-bannerhinweise-en/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;A navigation app needs three things beyond the line: turn prompts to read aloud, banners to display, and confidence that no known closure sits on the route.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="voice-and-banner-instructions"&gt;Voice and banner instructions&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="voice-and-banner-instructions"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#voice-and-banner-instructions" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink für diesen Abschnitt"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -s &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://api.mapx.at/v1/directions/driving/15.6256,48.2049;15.3294,48.2272?steps=true&amp;amp;voice_instructions=true&amp;amp;banner_instructions=true&amp;amp;language=en&amp;amp;overview=false&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; jq &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;.routes[0].legs[0].steps[1] | {voiceInstructions: .voiceInstructions[0], bannerInstructions: .bannerInstructions[0].primary}&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Code kopieren"
aria-label="Code kopieren"
data-copied-label="Kopiert!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On 8 Nov 2026 one step looked like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;voiceInstructions&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;distanceAlongGeometry&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;141.2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;announcement&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Turn left onto Dr.Ofner-Gasse&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;ssmlAnnouncement&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;lt;speak&amp;gt;...&amp;lt;/speak&amp;gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;bannerInstructions&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Dr.Ofner-Gasse&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;type&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;turn&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;modifier&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;left&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;driving_side&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;right&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Code kopieren"
aria-label="Code kopieren"
data-copied-label="Kopiert!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The format follows Mapbox (&lt;code&gt;announcement&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ssmlAnnouncement&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;primary&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;secondary&lt;/code&gt; with &lt;code&gt;components&lt;/code&gt;), so existing navigation UIs can be reused. Available for the driving profiles, &lt;code&gt;steps=true&lt;/code&gt; is required. Languages: &lt;code&gt;de&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;en&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="closures"&gt;Closures&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="closures"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#closures" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink für diesen Abschnitt"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;driving&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;driving-traffic&lt;/code&gt; profiles avoid binding full closures from the traffic reports (EVIS/ASFINAG) and list them:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -s &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://api.mapx.at/v1/directions/driving/14.2,48.27;14.45,48.30?overview=false&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; jq &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;.routes[0].closures_avoided&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Code kopieren"
aria-label="Code kopieren"
data-copied-label="Kopiert!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On 8 Nov 2026 this returned a ramp closure on the A7 near Linz, with category, road and the report text. Which closures are active changes constantly. Use &lt;code&gt;exclude=motorway&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;exclude=toll&lt;/code&gt; to avoid motorways or toll sections.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More: &lt;a href="https://docs.mapx.at/guides/navigation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;navigation guide&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://docs.mapx.at/guides/traffic/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;traffic&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>